    {
      "reviewerId": "113997917823230779150",
      "reviewerUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113997917823230779150?hl=id",
      "name": "Kelli M",
      "reviewerNumberOfReviews": 23,
      "isLocalGuide": true,
      "reviewerPhotoUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6_wrmVricDYmiA8xyROeOi_7BNY5S5BbjQw6ywIMjgLdupy4=s1920-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",
      "text": "My daughter and I are in town and stopped in while on a walk. If you’ve never been you need to go. I wish we lived nearby because Arena’s would be my go to florist. Their arrangement are unique and absolutely beautiful. The store has plants, candles, cards, decor and furniture. So many cute gift ideas",
      "textTranslated": "Saya dan putri saya sedang berada di kota dan mampir saat berjalan-jalan. Jika Anda belum pernah ke sana, Anda harus pergi. Saya berharap kami tinggal di dekat sini karena Arena's akan menjadi toko bunga favorit saya. Rangkaian bunganya unik dan benar-benar indah. Toko ini juga menjual tanaman, lilin, kartu ucapan, dekorasi, dan furnitur. Banyak sekali ide hadiah yang lucu.",
      "publishAt": "2 tahun lalu",
      "publishedAtDate": "2024-05-10T14:45:23.805Z",
      "likesCount": 0,
      "reviewId": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUNk83c1lBEAE",
      "reviewUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUNk83c1lBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x14e897f9fd01bae1!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICT6O7sYA%7C%7C?hl=id",
      "reviewOrigin": "Google",
      "stars": 5,
      "rating": null,
      "responseFromOwnerDate": "2024-05-10T21:08:59.000Z",
      "responseFromOwnerText": "Thank you for stopping by and the kind words.\nHope you come by again if you're ever back!",
