      "text": "Phoned in for a delivery of flowers for a relative's birthday. Even though they were pricey, they were obviously old and wilted. Not fresh. I will be looking for another florist in Rochester.,",
      "textTranslated": "Saya memesan pengiriman bunga untuk ulang tahun kerabat melalui telepon. Meskipun harganya mahal, bunga-bunga itu jelas sudah layu dan tidak segar. Saya akan mencari toko bunga lain di Rochester.",
      "publishAt": "2 tahun lalu",
      "publishedAtDate": "2023-11-11T15:29:34.806Z",
      "likesCount": 0,
      "reviewId": "ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGajgzV2xRRRAB",
      "reviewUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGajgzV2xRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x14e897f9fd01bae1!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDFj83WlQE%7C%7C?hl=id",
      "reviewOrigin": "Google",
      "stars": 1,
      "rating": null,
      "responseFromOwnerDate": "2023-11-11T20:31:45.000Z",
