    {
      "reviewerId": "114846997249197601031",
      "reviewerUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114846997249197601031?hl=id",
      "name": "Natasha Shokouhi",
      "reviewerNumberOfReviews": 303,
      "isLocalGuide": true,
      "reviewerPhotoUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOcXGwHLUOmsJDEEBswinYClQADHxlSbye8YU0WRTBLPqXoGk=s1920-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",
      "text": "I love Arena's, can't quite afford everything here but love it!\n\nThey have some of the most beautiful and most exquisite vintage pieces in the entire city. And the floral arrangements they do are GORG.\n\nThe store is lovely and carries some fun local made items as well as beautiful vintage pieces. They have two levels and lock the door, so you will need to ring the doorbell to be let in.\n\nYes, the prices are high. But again, some of the pieces are hard to find.\n\nI didn't experience any issues with customer service. They weren't the friendliest, but also not the rudest.\n\nParking is easy enough on the street.",
      "textTranslated": "Saya suka Arena's, meskipun tidak mampu membeli semuanya di sini, tapi saya menyukainya!\n\nMereka memiliki beberapa barang antik yang paling indah dan istimewa di seluruh kota. Dan rangkaian bunga yang mereka buat sangat cantik.\n\nTokonya indah dan menjual beberapa barang buatan lokal yang menarik serta barang-barang antik yang cantik. Toko ini memiliki dua lantai dan mengunci pintu, jadi Anda perlu membunyikan bel pintu untuk masuk.\n\nYa, harganya memang tinggi. Tapi sekali lagi, beberapa barangnya sulit ditemukan.\n\nSaya tidak mengalami masalah dengan layanan pelanggan. Mereka tidak terlalu ramah, tetapi juga tidak kasar.\n\nParkir cukup mudah di jalan.",
      "publishAt": "3 tahun lalu",
      "publishedAtDate": "2022-08-16T21:03:23.670Z",
      "likesCount": 0,
      "reviewId": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1b29fU1hBEAE",
